              ['restrictions on the advertising of confectionery before the evening broadcast watershed', 'Too narrow: one product and one time slot, not a ban aimed at children.'],
              ['school policies forbidding branded merchandise and sponsored teaching materials', 'A school rule, not a statutory ban on advertising.']
